+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+Each location has a `site` referencing an entry in `sites`. Batches,
+stock-takes and movements belong to the site of their location (movements
+through their batch). Schema 2 locations migrate to the `main` site; schema 1
+files migrate through schema 2. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
